abstract: >-
  An introduction to the QGIS interface, finding and loading vector data from
  public repositories, and basic cartography, with additional reading on map
  design. This module was taught as part of the Purdue-NSF GIS Cybertraining
  for the Social Sciences Workshop, a two-day workshop held at Purdue
  University in 2026, to GIS professionals and instructors (Day 1, Session A
  QGIS track, part 1).
